  "prefLabel": "Rev 705.06 Non-Payments",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 705.06 Non-Payments. An operator shall not be responsible, except as provided in Rev 705.08, for the remittance of any tax due as a result of non-collection of:\n\n(a) A dishonored check;\n\n(b) A credit card charge not honored by the issuing bank; or\n\n(c) Tax when a person leaves without paying.\n\nSource. #10714, eff 11-7-14 (from Rev 703.07); ss by #14105, eff 10-29-24, EXPIRES: 10-29-34 (formerly Rev 705.08)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev700.html"
